meta {
  name: Confirm Audit
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/audits/{{auditId}}
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "cliente": "new-client@example.com",
    "tecnico": "Ana Ruiz",
    "estado": "CONFIRMADA"
  }
}

docs {
  PUT with estado CONFIRMADA moves a PENDIENTE audit to CONFIRMADA.
  After this, further edits return 409 (a confirmed audit is immutable; only DELETE cancels it).
}
